<quiz><question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Linear Regression Analysis for Company's Cost and Output Data</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>For a period of three years, a company monitors the number of units of output produced per quarter and the total cost of producing the units. The table below shows their results</p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
      <th width="28%", style="text-align:center">Unit of output (x)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x1@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x2@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x3@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x4@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x5@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x6@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x7@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x8@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x9@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x10@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x11@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@x12@}\)</th>
  </tr>
   <tr>
      <th width="28%", style="text-align:center">Total cost (y)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y1@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y2@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y3@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y4@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y5@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y6@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y7@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y8@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y9@}\)</th>
      <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y10@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y11@}\)</th>
       <th width="6%", style="text-align:center">\({@y12@}\)</th>
  </tr>
 </table>
<p><b>Note:</b> Write your answers correct to \(2\) decimal places</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Write the equation of regression line \(y\) on \(x\) .</p>
<p>\(y=\) [[input:ans1]] x \(+\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans1]][[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Calculate the total cost when the unit price is \({@x13@}\)</p>
<p>Total cost \(= \)Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>

</li>
<ol>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
